Z||000007||Black88GT||06-30-2001||10:52 PM||||Just get the Joe Wynman chip, it eliminates the EGR and helps your 3.4 with fuel management issues.  You will need 19# or bigger injectors though and an AFPR.  Joe sells them for 100 dollars I believe, fierojo@bellatlantic.net||||reg||14
